    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久没有做旅行特辑了，今天也解锁了新嘉宾😁</span></p><p><span>shownotes就不写太详细的内容了，祝大家听歌愉快(´ᴗ`ʃƪ)</span></p><p><strong><span>「FujiRock」舞台巡礼</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">01:33</a></span></strong><strong><span>～</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1549">25:49</a></span></strong></p><p><span>·新嘉宾麻吉姐姐</span></p><p><span>·FujiRock的各个舞台</span></p><p><span>·最棒的山顶舞台</span></p><p><span>OP：清水靖晃-△E=△mc2=AMNESIA</span></p><p><span>BG：Yeah Yeah Yeahs - Maps</span></p><p><span>BG：Yeah Yeah Yeahs - Zero</span></p><p><span>BG：HYUKOH - 와리가리 (来来去去)</span></p><p><span>BG：GoGo Penguin-Murmuration</span></p><p><span>BG：GoGo Penguin - Atomised</span></p><p><span>BG：小林毅,あらゐ よしひこ-わっふ~音頭</span></p><p><span>MD：HYUKOH - 위잉위잉 (WI ING WI ING)</span></p><p><strong><span>「FujiRock」听歌环节</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1704">28:24</a></span></strong><strong><span>～</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3454">57:34</a></span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 平沢進-ルベド</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2076">34:36</a> The xx (XX乐队) - Intro</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2311">38:31</a> Turnstile - MYSTERY</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2484">41:24</a> 平沢進 - 白虎野の娘 (白虎野的姑娘) (Paprika Version)</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2692">44:52</a> HYUKOH,张基河 - Silverhair Express (장기하 Remix)</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2982">49:42</a> Loyle Carner, Jordan Rakei - Ottolenghi</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3165">52:45</a> </span><strong><span>Vaundy - 踊り子 (舞女)</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>「FujiRock」感受闲谈环节 </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3454">57:34</a></span></strong><strong><span>～</span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6450">107:30</a></span></strong></p><p><span>·吃吃喝喝的趣事——汤咖喱の传说</span></p><p><span>·跟天气和解是Fujirock的必修课</span></p><p><span>·一次比一次更好的体验 源于自我迭代🤷‍♂️</span></p><p><span>·怀念剪刀手</span></p><p><span>·许愿与人生的走马灯</span></p><p><strong><span>ED：Angine de Poitrine - Tamebsz</span></strong></p><p><span>主播：马赛克丨李安</span></p><p><span>嘉宾：麻吉姐姐</span></p><p><span>节目制作：马赛克</span></p><p><strong><span>特别鸣谢：新公园NewParkCafe</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>新公园NewParkCafe，是一个披着「咖啡馆」外衣的人文城市空间。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>每月，会深入一个具体主题，通过沙龙、工坊、书影音交流会、现场表演、展览、播客、文化桌游等多元形式，层层展开认知和情感的对话。我们坚信人类精神的复杂性与开放性，对人本身渴望这种丰富性有信念。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>全平台社媒账号：新公园NewParkCafe</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>地址：深圳南山区蛇口南海意库1栋107B</span></strong></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkwArRwke-FYqSHXP4E3ZCTJkdBv.PNG"><p></p>]]></description>
