  <item>
    <title>vol.50 史记·李将军列传 一个没有出路的良家子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab37daff04646b3a955e27b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ab37daff04646b3a955e27b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 07:29:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今年年初挖的坑，才九月份就填上了，我可真厉害呢🤷‍♂️</span></p><p><span>今天的节目，是我近期最爱读的一篇史记列传。李将军的人生还是很抚慰到了我，与他相比，我一时一晌的小小挫折简直不值一提🤷‍♂️</span></p><p><span>这一集节目献给每一个感觉到自己被辜负了的良家子们（自我认同是的就算😈）。</span></p><p><span>以下是本集节目的shownotes：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a> </span><strong><span>正文</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a> 良家子李广</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="474">07:54</a> “惜乎，子不遇时！”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 昌邑之战——原来曾经这么近</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1174">19:34</a> 射雕者の追击战</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1673">27:53</a> 李广与程不识</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2090">34:50</a> 马邑之谋</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2292">38:12</a> 雁门大战</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2544">42:24</a> 李广的gap year</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2922">48:42</a> 李广在右北平</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3580">59:40</a> 李广的peer pressure</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">62:00</a> 右北平之战</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4372">72:52</a> 李广的最后一战</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5072">84:32</a> 故事的尾声</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5650">94:10</a> 闲聊部分</span></p><p><span>OP：国际首席爱乐乐团-历史的天空</span></p><p><span>BG：黎允文-《三国之见龙卸甲影视OST》</span></p><p><span>BG：Alejandro Amenábar - End Credits (Instrumental)</span></p><p><span>BG：James Horner - The Ludlows (Legends Of The Fall)</span></p><p><span>BG：JAY PRICE - Hero</span></p><p><span>BG：Zamfir-The Lonely Shepherd</span></p><p><span>BG：童安格 - 成吉思汗</span></p><p><span>MD：关正杰 - 万水千山纵横</span></p><p><span>ED：周华健 - 下午的一出戏</span></p>]]></description>
