    <guid isPermaLink="false">69cf7bb1e2c8be31554ace46</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 03 Apr 2026 08:41:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好啊，这是我们野猪林第一次尝试两集联播。今天我们来吧朱贵的故事讲完。</span></p><span></span><p><span>接着上集我们隐藏的故事情节，这次立下奇功回到梁山的朱贵很快就迎来了人生中的转折点，开始走上了一条漫长的下坡路。</span></p><span></span><p><span>朱贵的故事所具有的普遍性，在今天这个时代越来越得到凸显了。不知道大家对上下分集的形式是不是感到满意，也欢迎大家多多留言讨论。</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下是本集节目的shownotes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:31</a> 四方酒店-朱贵被分权的起点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a> 第一次人事调整</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 为什么要分权</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="856">14:16</a> </span><strong><span>朱贵的大败局-他说错了什么话</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1126">18:46</a> </span></strong><span>分权后的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1438">23:58</a> 第二次架构调整</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1761">29:21</a> 第三次架构调整</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1909">31:49</a> 跳出舒适圈的朱贵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2088">34:48</a> 梁山惊变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2201">36:41</a> 晁盖的灵魂时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2346">39:06</a> 朱贵的职务性死亡-韩伯龙事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2899">48:19</a> 朱贵的人生结局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2960">49:20</a> 梁山泊分金大买市</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3073">51:13</a> 朱贵的人生悲剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3185">53:05</a> </span><strong><span>朱贵的天人之际</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>OP：张行-一条路</span></p><span></span><p><span>BG：岩代太郎-Shadow Of The Evanescence</span></p><span></span><p><span>BG：岩代太郎-Closing In Upon The Enemy</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：李宗盛-远行</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkwArRwke-FYqSHXP4E3ZCTJkdBv.PNG"></figure>]]></description>
