    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好久不见，今天我们继续来讲水浒传的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本次要讲的是梁山初期的创业元老，来自沂水县的长腿欧巴—旱地忽律朱贵。此次做他的节目是真的比想象中复杂得多，因而我们也决定将节目拆分为上下两集，来细致地分析一下这个人物。</span></p><span></span><p><span>以往读水浒传，有种照镜子的感受。这一次读朱贵的故事，仿佛见到了某种预言。</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下是本集节目的shownotes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> 朱贵的影视形象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="371">06:11</a> 朱贵与鳄鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="732">12:12</a> 林教头の简历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="981">16:21</a> 朱贵的两个第一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1163">19:23</a> 梁山人事工作的开创者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1354">22:34</a> 低端领导王伦和他的高端梁山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1541">25:41</a> 好人朱贵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1875">31:15</a> 梁山双璧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1972">32:52</a> 生辰纲小分队的上山之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2065">34:25</a> 王伦の末日</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2278">37:58</a> 魅力型领袖晁盖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2698">44:58</a> 戴宗の失误</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2843">47:23</a> 混乱的劫法场行动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3040">50:40</a> 朱贵下山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3303">55:03</a> 本集隐藏的故事情节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3437">57:17</a> 拯救恶人李逵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3661">61:01</a> 美好的结尾</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：詹姆斯霍纳-The Ludlows</span></p><span></span><p><span>BG：西皮士-寒山</span></p><span></span><p><span>BG：约伊格鲁特曼-schnappi</span></p><span></span><p><span>BG：岩代太郎-Closing In Upon The Enemy</span></p><span></span><p><span>BG：岩代太郎-Shadow Of The Evanescence</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：李宗盛-和自己赛跑的人</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkwArRwke-FYqSHXP4E3ZCTJkdBv.PNG"></figure>]]></description>
