  <item>
    <title>vol.42 聊斋志异：《公孙九娘》不和解 不原谅 不遗忘</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6991493da22480add630e8e9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6991493da22480add630e8e9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Feb 2026 04:31:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《公孙九娘》是《聊斋志异》当中的大名篇，也是蒲老先生写作的很独特的一个故事。我对本集节目的效果也比较满意，唯一美中不足的，大概就是这个故事与春节的祥和氛围似乎有些不搭🤷</span></p><span></span><p><span>但不管怎样，还是感谢您的收听，与此同时也祝愿各位朋友能够在这个春节假期里，获得阅读的乐趣😄</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下是本集节目的shownotes：</span></p><span></span><p><span>楔子·蒲槃的一生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 关于此前被简单理解的蒲槃先生</span></p><span></span><p><span>·蒲槃一生中经历过的四次大动乱：吴桥兵变、谢迁之乱、于七之乱*2</span></p><span></span><p><span>·蒲槃的人生选择：弃儒从贾</span></p><span></span><p><span>·蒲槃的家族伤痛：蒲柷之死</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>正文·《公孙九娘》——<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1287">21:27</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1348">22:28</a> </span></strong><span>蒲松龄先生的勇气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1525">25:25</a> 男主角莱阳生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1638">27:18</a> 永远年轻的朱生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1885">31:25</a> 莱阳生的外甥女</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2168">36:08</a> 鬼村·莱霞里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2456">40:56</a> 女主角公孙九娘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3178">52:58</a> 鬼村·婚礼现场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3395">56:35</a> 很酷的公孙老太太</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> </span><strong><span>公孙九娘的诗</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4025">67:05</a> </span></strong><span>告别鬼村</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4605">76:45</a> 坏结局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4678">77:58</a> 不懂爱情的我们 怎么看《公孙九娘》</span></p><span></span><p><span>还是祝大家春节快乐，也欢迎你们加入我们的听友群来一起玩耍👇</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkwArRwke-FYqSHXP4E3ZCTJkdBv.PNG"></figure>]]></description>
