    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/697c9a36073030367a7cb798</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">697c9a36073030367a7cb798</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 30 Jan 2026 11:56:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>迟来一个月的年终总结终于完成了，在这个忙碌的一月份里我们也终于等到了属于我们野猪林自己的夸夸墙。</span></p><span></span><p><span>过去的这一年是我与李安专心经营播客的一年，也感谢大家的青睐，为我们的生活带来了诸多乐趣和宽慰。很多想说的话都在节目里了，希望大家听得开心😁</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下是本集节目的shownotes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">01:38</a> 主播版的年度总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 播客使人相聚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">11:54</a> 野猪林的新气象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="829">13:49</a> 关于听友群</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="857">14:17</a> 新年挖新坑-太史公和《史记》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1196">19:56</a> 关于播客未来的展望和思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1265">21:05</a> 开始做播客的私心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1494">24:54</a> 关于接到商务这件事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1679">27:59</a> 为什么野猪林的产量一直上不去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1958">32:38</a> 听友群感恩环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2076">34:36</a> 年度满意单集</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/684869e51c45a63232899b40" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/684869e51c45a63232899b40"><span>意外之喜的白胜</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68a5adf8293471fed49859d9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68a5adf8293471fed49859d9"><span>后劲十足的童姥</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2565">42:45</a> 野猪林年度推荐播客单集</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c7f44428b184b76be057f3" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c7f44428b184b76be057f3"><span>圣彼得堡一别，再也没见过那个爱吃红烧肉的朝鲜同志</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">46:30</a> 野猪林年度推荐播客电台</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6635d36a6c8dc4fff7d70d59" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6635d36a6c8dc4fff7d70d59"><span>拾话说</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62dd4584cb0fbfffaf9dd69c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62dd4584cb0fbfffaf9dd69c"><span>扯远了</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3273">54:33</a> 最后想说的话</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkwArRwke-FYqSHXP4E3ZCTJkdBv.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>OP：王菲-哔一声之后</span></p><span></span><p><span>BG：久石让-Clifside Waltz, Pt. 1</span></p><span></span><p><span>BG：久石让-Silent Love (Forever)</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：张震岳-无名的情歌</span></p>]]></description>
