    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Nov 2025 10:34:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“多餐人肉双睛赤 火眼狻猊是邓飞”我们今天来讲一讲梁山排名第四十九位的饮马川二当家·火眼狻猊·邓飞。邓飞作为杨林宇宙里的梁山著名好人，在影视剧里的表现不多，仅有的几次发言也是作为介绍他人的旁白讲解员。但是正因为施老的妙笔，仅仅靠动作戏的描写，邓飞通过战场表现也留下了令人印象深刻的高光时刻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>邓飞代表的那一座饮马川也是我在读水浒过程当中，最喜欢的一座山头。饮马川代表的那个风景秀丽水绕风环的避难所，如果叫我穿越回去做喽啰，我一定会选择饮马川。</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下是本集节目的shownotes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> 今天的主角·火眼狻猊·邓飞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="171">02:51</a> 邓飞的出场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> 好一座饮马川</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="503">08:23</a> 我带你认识认识饮马川里的人儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1082">18:02</a> 饮马川的雅集</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1401">23:21</a> 祝家庄之战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2036">33:56</a> 战后总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2259">37:39</a> 二救秦明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2437">40:37</a> 名次上的肯定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2535">42:15</a> 邓飞的结局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2774">46:14</a> 大魔王·石宝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3008">50:08</a> 为什么要讲邓飞</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：赵季平-兄弟情谊</span></p><span></span><p><span>BG：胡伟丽-野猪林</span></p><span></span><p><span>BG：赵季平-殊死一战</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：成龙-红太阳</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkwArRwke-FYqSHXP4E3ZCTJkdBv.PNG"></figure>]]></description>
